# 仅允许构建所需源码进入上下文，数据库、密钥、备份、个人配置及临时文件均不发送。
*
!pom.xml
!src/
src/*
!src/main/
!src/main/**
!frontend/
frontend/*
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
!frontend/index.html
!frontend/tsconfig*.json
!frontend/vite.config.ts
!frontend/src/
!frontend/src/**
!frontend/public/
!frontend/public/**
!tools/
tools/*
!tools/finance/
tools/finance/*
!tools/finance/news.py
!tools/finance/web_search.py
!tools/finance/requirements.txt
!deploy/
deploy/*
!deploy/backend.Dockerfile
!deploy/frontend.Dockerfile
!deploy/nginx.conf
!deploy/check-health.py
!deploy/extract-sqlite.py
# 防止上层目录的重新包含意外带入本机依赖、环境配置或数据。
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.wealthflow
**/.venv-finance
**/__pycache__
